ment Prior Uniform Statutory Provi- sion: None. Purposes: 1. Subsection (1) permits a seller who has made a non-conforming ten- der in any case to make a conforming delivery within the contract time upon seasonable notification to the buyer. It § 2–508ARTICLE 2. SALES"